/*
================================================================================
VELOCITY X - Master Material: M_RoadMarking_Master
Asset Path: /Game/Materials/Road/M_RoadMarking_Master
Target Use: Highway lane dividers (dashed white), shoulder lines (solid white/yellow),
            center median markings, hazard chevrons

PBR SPECIFICATION & PARAMETER REGISTRY:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. MARKING TYPES & COLOR PARAMETERS:
   - Param "MarkingColor" (LinearColor, Default=(0.95, 0.95, 0.92, 1.0)):
     Highway reflective thermoplastic white.
   - Param "YellowMarkingColor" (LinearColor, Default=(1.0, 0.72, 0.08, 1.0)):
     Median warning / emergency shoulder yellow.
   - Param "bUseYellowLine" (StaticSwitch, Default=False)

2. PROCEDURAL STRIPE GENERATOR (UV or Mesh based):
   - Param "bProceduralDashPattern" (StaticSwitch, Default=False):
     When true, generates 3m line / 9m gap pattern along U coordinate mathematically.
   - Param "DashLength_cm" (Scalar, Default=300.0 cm): Standard highway stripe length.
   - Param "DashGap_cm" (Scalar, Default=900.0 cm): Standard highway gap length.
   - Param "LineWidth_cm" (Scalar, Default=15.0 cm): Standard lane line width.

3. RETROREFLECTIVE GLASS BEAD SIMULATION:
   - Param "BeadRetroreflectivity" (Scalar, Default=3.5):
     Simulates micro glass spheres embedded in highway paint that retro-reflect headlight beams.
     Implements Fresnel / View-Dependent back-scatter:
     RetroGlow = pow(dot(CameraVector, LightVector), 8.0) * BeadRetroreflectivity;
   - Param "Roughness_Dry" (Scalar, Default=0.38): Smooth thermoplastic resin.
   - Param "Roughness_Wet" (Scalar, Default=0.12): Wet road marking.

4. WEAR & CHIPPING MASK:
   - Param "WearIntensity" (Scalar, Default=0.25): Controls paint flaking / chip-off.
   - Param "WearNoiseTiling" (Scalar, Default=15.0): Frequency of edge disintegration.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
MATERIAL INSTANCES GENERATED:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. MI_LaneMarking_Dashed_White:
   - MarkingColor = (0.95, 0.95, 0.92)
   - bProceduralDashPattern = True
   - DashLength = 300 cm, GapLength = 900 cm

2. MI_LaneMarking_Solid_White:
   - MarkingColor = (0.95, 0.95, 0.92)
   - bProceduralDashPattern = False

3. MI_LaneMarking_Solid_Yellow:
   - bUseYellowLine = True
   - YellowMarkingColor = (1.0, 0.72, 0.08)
   - bProceduralDashPattern = False
================================================================================
*/
